      "writtenOn": "2017-07-18T01:30:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But then wouldn\u0027t there be confusion between id and tag_id? That sounds like a bug waiting to happen.\n\nIn truth this resource probably shouldn\u0027t ever be queried or filtered by the id from a user perspective since tags aren\u0027t shared across multiple projects, and most queries will be by name.\n\nBut... If there is a use case to have the id usable, what\u0027s wrong with UUID as PK? All other Keystone resources seem to already do that, makes sense to keep that convention the same.",
